  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Coordinator, EU HQ</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Medicinsk koordinator, EU:s h&#xF6;gkvarter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den efterstr&#xE4;vade effekten av st&#xF6;det &#xE4;r att insatserna p&#xE5; ett b&#xE4;ttre s&#xE4;tt kan omh&#xE4;nderta de medicinska behoven hos sin personal, vilket &#xF6;kar s&#xE4;kerheten och bidrar till en positiv effekt p&#xE5; effektiviteten och kvaliteten p&#xE5; personalens arbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The desired effect of the support is that the EU civilian cirisis management missions can better address the medical needs of their staff, which increases safety and contributes to a positive effect on the efficiency and quality of the staff&apos;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For several years now, MSB has provided support to CPCC, the headquarters for the EU&apos;s civilian crisis management efforts in the healthcare area, in the form of a medical advisor/coordinator. His role has been actualized and highlighted not least during the pandemic. For a long time, MSB has worked for CPCC to have two people with the role of medical advisor/coordinator, which has been realized. This has made it possible for, in addition to the purely operational support provided to the civil operations, work to be initiated in a number of strategic areas, such as for example regarding routines, procedures and documentation for investigations, evacuations, etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSB har sedan ett flertal &#xE5;r gett st&#xF6;d till CPCC, huvudkontoret f&#xF6;r EU:s civila krishanteringsinsatser inom sjukv&#xE5;rdsomr&#xE5;det i form av en medicinsk r&#xE5;dgivare/samordnare. Dennes roll har aktualiserats och lyfts inte minst under pandemin. MSB har under en l&#xE4;ngre tid verkat f&#xF6;r att det vid CPCC ska finnas tv&#xE5; personer med rollen som medicinsk r&#xE5;dgivare/samordnare, vilket har realiserats. Detta har m&#xF6;jliggjort att ut&#xF6;ver det rent operativa st&#xF6;d som l&#xE4;mnas till de civila insatserna, &#xE4;ven arbete kunnat initieras inom ett antal strategiska omr&#xE5;den, s&#xE5;som exempelvis avseende rutiner, procedurer och dokumentation f&#xF6;r unders&#xF6;kningar, evakueringar etc. MSB sekonderad personal till EU huvudkvarter f&#xF6;r civila missioner med expertis inom h&#xE4;lso/sjukv&#xE5;rdsfr&#xE5;gor f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka s&#xE4;kerheten f&#xF6;r personalen i missionerna</narrative>
  </description>
